<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-TOP 10 QUALIFIERS FOR INDYCAR RACE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-TOP 10 QUALIFIERS FOR INDYCAR RACE.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wisconsin 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top 10</p>
<p>qualifiers on Saturday for Sunday's Miller 200 CART race</p>
<p>(tabulate by driver, chassis, motor, lap time and fastest</p>
<p>speed):</p>
<p>1. Paul Tracy (Canada), Penske Mercedes-Benz, 20.160</p>
<p>seconds, 184.286 mph (296.571 kph)</p>
<p>2. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil), Reynard Mercedes-Benz,</p>
<p>20.385</p>
<p>3. Raul Boesel (Brazil), Reynard Ford, 20.434</p>
<p>4. Patrick Carpentier (Canada), Reynard Mercedes-Benz,</p>
<p>20.440</p>
<p>5. Greg Moore (Canada), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 20.445</p>
<p>6. Parker Johnstone (U.S.), Reynard Honda, 20.568</p>
<p>7. Dario Franchitti (Britain), Reynard Mercedes-Benz,</p>
<p>20.588</p>
<p>8. Scott Pruett (U.S.), Reynard Ford, 20.682</p>
<p>9. Al Unser, Jr. (U.S.), Penske Mercedes-Benz, 20.708</p>
<p>10. Roberto Moreno (Brazil), Swift Ford, 20.741</p>
</text>
